# The repo stores text as LF. Without this, a Windows checkout gets CRLF working
# copies while git's blobs stay LF, and `prettier --check` then reports every
# line of every older file as drifted - noise that hides the handful of files
# genuinely out of style (it once turned 2 real drifts into a 7-file report).
* text=auto eol=lf
